        "分子：$h(t) - h(2) = (80 - 4.9t^2) - (80 - 4.9 \\cdot 4) = -4.9(t^2 - 4) = -4.9(t - 2)(t + 2)$。",
        "除以 $t - 2$（$t \\ne 2$）：$-4.9(t + 2)$。",
